  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "Get scene live state"
 },
 "description": "What a scene has on air. Answers streams: each stream that plays it, with its id (stream), name and state and, under onAir while it runs, the frame/<id> on air (frame) and the one cued next, the controls' values, each source's status and what its playlists play. With no stream playing it, streams is empty and summary says how to put it on air.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
